          "text_sha256": "2b4646d87c241bc56820f58d83d1fd3911c132305de1ec7897c4900aca85b185",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 143,
          "quote": "誕妃卽湛之女鑠妃湛妹也"
        },
        {
          "chapter_path": "corpus/songshu/071-wangsengchuo.json",
          "source_id": "s-songshu-071-wangsengchuo",
          "chapter_id": "c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo",
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003",
          "text_sha256": "61c3d7bce6852c7de3050998d3051b618367f0c3bc9d443398922aef17dceb05",
          "start": 90,
          "end": 101,
          "quote": "誕妃即湛之女鑠妃即湛妹"
        }
      ],
      "reading": "誕妃為徐湛之女，鑠妃為江湛妹。本名未出；不得混作兩位父女。"
    },
    {
